WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.310
The year is 2205 A.D.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.860
To annihilate the History Retrograde Army,
who scheme to alter history...

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.660
...we, who were born from swords,

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:24.580
engage in mortal combat today as well!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.650
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.310
How about some after-breakfast tea?

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:11.610
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.480
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.410
This is...?

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:30.580
That's... Osaka Castle...

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.800
Ichi-<i>nii</i>...

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.130
Brother...

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.980
Ichi-<i>nii</i>!

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.810
Brother!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:12.460
I gathered some horse dung...

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.040
Huh? You don't need any?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:25.930
Oh, are you a newly arrived friend?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.140
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:33.730
"50 - Tachi, Juzumaru Tsunetsugu"

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:33.730
I am one of the Five Great Swords
of Japan, called Juzumaru Tsunetsugu.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.730
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.360
I am called Yamabushi Kunihiro.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.570
Nice to meet you!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.660
Oh, are you copying sutras?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.410
How pious of you to
follow the way of the Buddha.

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.240
Do you also?

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.330
Yes, but one that is different from yours.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.000
There is not just one way of the Buddha.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.830
That is true.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:58.960
I want to be so strong that I can
blow everything away with a smile.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.470
I train day and night to that end.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.760
That sounds quite interesting.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.060
Today, I also intend to seclude myself
in the mountains and fields to train.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.560
May I join you in your training?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.890
Ka, ka, ka!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.940
Of course.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.770
Sounds interesting.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.270
Can I go, too?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:22.280
Yes! There are paths that can
only be seen with many people.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.830
Huh? Why am I here, too?!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.380
Well, you are responsible for
the new Sword Warriors, aren't you?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.550
Then, why is Doudanuki here?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:44.260
I heard you guys were doing
some bodybuilding, so I came along.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.890
Ka, ka, ka!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:51.890
Then first, let us aim
for the top of this mountain!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:55.730
What? We're gonna climb the mountain?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.480
Jeez, all right already!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.860
Kashuu, we are not going that way.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.860
Huh?

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.740
<i>This</i> is the way of the Buddha!

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.280
What?!

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.280
Let us go!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.870
Let us apply ourselves to our training.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.330
This is a worthy opponent!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.170
Wait...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:23.880
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.100
It has gotten a bit warmer,
hasn't it, Uguisumaru-<i>sama</i>?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.310
You're right. It is a good
season to drink tea now.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.230
You two.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.480
Have you seen Yamabushi?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.690
I wanted to ask him
to help with the chores...

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.240
He said something about
training in the mountains.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.950
He went off to train again?

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.200
Yes, along with the others...

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.830
"Ka, ka, ka, ka! It's time to train!"

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.500
he said, and left with
Juzumaru-<i>san</i> and Doudanuki-<i>san</i>--

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.710
Oh, Nikkari-<i>san</i> and
Kashuu-<i>san</i> were there, too.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.710
Yamabushi's training, huh?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.210
Is something the matter?

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:08.340
I joined Yamabushi for training before...

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.550
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka...

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.510
...but it was a state of madness.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:14.560
If things don't go well,
lives could even be lost!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:17.520
To talk about losing lives
during training is not very peaceful.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.520
I wonder if Kashuu-<i>san</i>
and the others will be okay?

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:29.860
You... aren't going to say
we're climbing this, are you?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:34.450
Come, let us go!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.080
Ka, ka, ka!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:44.840
What's that?

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.380
I can't lose either!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.510
I'll climb and train and the same time!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.300
What?!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.810
Anyway, it'll be hard to
go further with these sandals.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.440
I have <i>tabi</i> here. Do you want to use them?

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.900
<i>T-Tabi</i>?

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.650
They have a grip on the bottom,
so it'll be easier to climb.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.780
I guess I'll borrow them, then.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.820
Is what you want...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.700
...these regular <i>tabi</i>?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:24.040
Or these golden <i>tabi</i>, 
rather, these gold-<i>tabi</i>?

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.210
Time to go, I guess...

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.930
I'm finally here...

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:37.100
Good work.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:42.600
Huh? How were you so fast, Nikkari?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.400
I took the easier alternate 
route to get here.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:47.020
"Alternate Route"

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.780
What? No fair!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.240
Next is the conclusion of our training!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.820
Don't tell me we'll be
training under a waterfall?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.530
This is a splendid waterfall.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:59.450
But I don't like getting wet...

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.830
I have clothes for you.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.880
Well then, is what you want...

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.380
...this white garment,

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:15.890
or this golden kimono, I mean, gold--

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:16.640
All right!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.850
Time to go, I guess...

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.020
Who will go first?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.140
I will go.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:27.190
Juzumaru Tsunetsugu, as my waterfall
training is slightly different from the usual,

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.020
make sure to prepare yourself.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.490
Here I go.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.490
Then I will, too.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:46.960
<i>Namu myouhou renge kyou</i>...
<i>Namu myouhou renge kyou</i>...

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.840
Here I go!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.390
Roar,

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.930
my muscles!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.810
<i>Haja kenshou</i>!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.490
As expected of one of
the Five Great Swords of Japan.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.330
That was excellent, Juzumaru Tsunetsugu!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.450
I was a little surprised.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.580
Next, Kashuu! How about it?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.420
Huh?

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.210
If you can overcome this training,

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:34.130
then you may receive strength
to allow you to face any crisis!

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:35.800
Strength, huh?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.140
Okay already, I'll do it!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.680
Strength to face any crisis!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.020
To face... any crisis...

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.070
I can't do this!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.240
I'm so cold...

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.000
I warmed this up for you.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.830
No thanks, I'm fine.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.670
You can't fight or train if you're hungry.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.260
Let's eat.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.220
It was my first time undergoing
such intense training.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.680
Ka, ka, ka!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.980
There may also be a way of the Buddha

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:31.440
where you see, feel, and do things
differently from what you normally would.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:35.400
Yes, I feel like new 
teachings have opened up.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.490
Challenging everything
to continuously better oneself.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:44.370
We are weapons, so it's fine
as long as we become stronger.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.370
Stronger, huh?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.830
Come, will you have
some of this rice porridge?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.720
Yamabushi-<i>dono</i>.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.640
Will you allow me
to join in your training again?

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.140
Of course!

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.930
Now that our stomachs are full,

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.400
let us run back to the citadel!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.520
Training doesn't end
until you're home, huh?

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.820
Just what I wished for.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.740
I'm looking forward to the way back, too.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:25.280
Enough with the training already!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.370
Honebami, you look sleepy.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.420
Yeah.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.050
You have to make sure you sleep properly.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:39.170
It's because you were
snoring on top of me, Brother.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.340
Sorry, sorry.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:45.050
But this room is getting
kind of cramped, huh?

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.060
I'm going first.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.310
Oh, I'll go too.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.520
Honebami, you hurry up and come, too.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.270
Okay.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.610
You okay?

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:05.410
Yeah...

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.200
I have an important
mission for you gentlemen.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.410
This citadel is currently...

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.380
...experiencing a lack of funds!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.380
I cannot believe I let this happen
while I was our master's attendant!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.760
Master! I humbly apologize!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:23.220
We've been doing things to get by,

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.550
but we have more Sword Warriors now,
too, so it's getting tight.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:30.430
Well, we had a lavish
New Year's celebration, too.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.140
In the basement of Osaka Castle,

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.150
there might be buried treasure
left by the Toyotomi family.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:39.440
Whatever coins you find there
can be used as funds for this citadel.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.110
You mean, we can bring it back?

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:46.070
I have heard that the Toyotomi
buried treasure is worth a lot.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.530
It's like a treasure hunt. Sounds fun!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.450
So that's why we were chosen, huh?

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.000
Apparently so.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.330
I don't know about you, Ichi-<i>nii</i>,

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.710
but I was burned up
and don't remember parts of it...

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.210
You too, right, Honebami?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.220
Yes. All I remember are flames.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.970
Flames that burned all of me up.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:10.470
This is Master we're talking about.
They must have a reason for this formation.

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.770
The captain is Ichigo Hitofuri.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:15.020
You will now be dispatched!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.480
Ichi-<i>nii</i>, let's get going!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.820
I forgot something. I'll be right back.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.200
--Hey, wait, Honebami...
--The buried treasure is calling me!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.660
"Osaka Castle"

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.330
Everyone, are you ready?

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.580
Let's go!

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:33.870
"Transport"

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.210
Wait a minute! Honebami's--

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:46.840
I must go after them.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.970
If I remember correctly, they were...

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.020
"Keichou Era"

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.320
Brother? Where are you?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.740
This is...

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.460
Ichi-<i>nii</i>...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.710
Brother...

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.420
Honebami's not here yet?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.670
Let's hurry up and get going!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.800
I'm sure he'll catch up soon.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.680
Ichi-<i>nii</i>...

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.220
What is it?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.640
This is where we burned...

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.430
Yes, this is where it was.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.690
If we redid the past so
that Osaka Castle didn't burn--

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.860
We can't do that.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.400
Then we'd be no better than the enemy.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:48.700
Let's believe in our current master.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.530
You're right.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.410
I was just kidding.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.700
Sorry for saying something weird.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.920
But man, Honebami's taking a long time.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.500
Maybe he doesn't know
how to use the equipment.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.670
Yeah, maybe.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.630
Jeez, I guess I have no choice.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.390
I'll go and get him.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.180
Honebami?

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.900
Honebami!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.030
Brother...?

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.160
Oh, you're awake!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.250
Sorry!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.960
It's because I was rushing everyone...

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.540
I'm glad.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:46.800
I...

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.260
You were passed out
in front of Osaka Castle.

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.880
I see. I'm sorry.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.470
I'm really glad you're okay.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:57.510
Everyone, let's call it a day.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.640
I'll make the report to Master.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.770
--Okay!
--All right.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.980
Honebami, you should get some rest, too.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.410
With this...

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.880
Honebami?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.170
"Osaka Castle"

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.680
There you are!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.730
Honebami!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.620
Honebami!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.380
Ichi-<i>nii</i>, everyone...

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.920
Why?

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.760
Honebami, what are you doing?

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.260
I...

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:23.930
...want to make it so that
Ichi-<i>nii</i> and Brother don't burn.

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:25.810
If you do that, you'll 
be just like the enemy--

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:29.320
I'll just move them
somewhere else during this fire.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:34.610
If I put them back after,
it shouldn't affect human history.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:38.910
It's fine if I'm the only one
bearing the pain of lost memories.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.160
It would be better if Ichi-<i>nii</i> didn't burn.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.660
Even so--

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:49.420
I have also thought about what it
would've been like if I hadn't burned.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:55.380
But if we hadn't burned, then Ichi-<i>nii</i>
and I wouldn't be who we are now.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:18:02.010
Coming to this citadel and being
with everyone is so much fun every day.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.430
Even if I don't really remember the past,

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:07.770
I have so much fun that I don't care.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:14.740
But if I hadn't burned here,
then I might be a different me.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:20.530
Besides, since I lost my memories,
it makes me treasure the present even more.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:25.450
That's why I'm sure we're fine like this.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.910
Brother...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.250
Haven't I always said not
to look back at the past?

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.300
Let's get back to the citadel.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.590
Master's worried, too.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.300
Everyone's waiting.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.850
Let's go home, Honebami.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.310
Sorry... everyone...

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.280
The Kebiishi?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:59.820
They might have realized that we were
thinking of interfering with this time period.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.820
But we didn't do anything yet!

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.620
They don't look like
they'll listen to reason, though.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.540
Not being able to return
to the citadel with everyone

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.420
is worse than getting burned!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.710
Here they come!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:17.720
No touching!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.640
Charge!

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.930
Damn it.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.860
There!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.300
Prepare yourself.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.350
Midare! Atsushi!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:13.850
Damn it, beating us up like that...

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:21.070
I won't let you lay a
finger on my little brothers!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.280
Ichi-<i>nii</i>!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.290
I won't forgive anyone

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.080
who hurts my brothers!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.710
And this is...

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.750
...my special move!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.220
Are you okay?

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.260
Yeah.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.390
They were tough opponents.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.930
I'm glad you're all okay.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.370
I'm sooo tired...

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:15.210
I can't believe we got
that lost on our way back.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:17.330
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.130
This is also training!

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.880
Don't keep training
even after you get home!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:24.720
Feels good, doesn't it?

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:27.760
It sounds like you went
through some harsh training.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:31.390
Yeah well, I'll probably
get dispatched all the time now.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:35.600
Speaking of which, I saw you
all getting scolded by Hasebe...

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.150
Did something happen?

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.560
"Use without permission strictly forbidden!"

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.150
Well, this and that...

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:44.990
But it was a little exciting.

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:49.240
Well, no one will be going anywhere
without telling Master first after this.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:52.580
It's not something to be praised for,

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:56.500
but I've made another new
memory with my little brothers.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.630
Oh, a shooting star!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.670
Huh? Where?

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:04.670
Gotta make a wish!

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.470
I wish someone will buy me cute clothes!

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:10.470
I wish I can fill my stomach
with delicious meat!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:14.020
I wish to complete my new medicine.

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:20.690
--I wish tomorrow will be a good day, too!
--I wish tomorrow will be good, too.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:24:01.590
"More Hanamaru Next Week!!"
